WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.120
Part four: stands and time sheets. When a stand lead can't send in the hours, for example their phone died, you can do it for them.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:16.819
On the admin home screen, Stands lists every stand from the last three days, with its lead and where its sheet stands.

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:25.126
Sent means the sheet went out and nothing is back yet. Partly in is a stand with no lead, where some people have logged their own time.

00:00:25.326 --> 00:00:28.185
Approved stands are done, so they have no button.

00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:31.340
Tap Time sheet to open a stand's sheet.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.564
It's the same page the stand lead uses, with your admin banner on top.

00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:38.685
You can text the crew from here, too.

00:00:38.885 --> 00:00:47.640
Check each person against the paper sign-in sheet, the same way the lead would. The stand-hours video covers this page step by step.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:53.056
The photo of the paper sign-in sheet is required. Get it from the stand lead.

00:00:53.256 --> 00:00:57.353
Type the stand lead's name. It's saved as Admin, your name, for them.

00:00:57.553 --> 00:01:06.400
Tap Submit for approval. A sheet sent by an admin doesn't give the lead stand-lead credit automatically. The liaison can add it.
